+/*
+ * Helper routines for Perle IOLAN serial port support
+ *
+ * This module provides utility functions and device handling for Perle IOLAN
+ * serial port cards, including media type management, signal handling, and
+ * forwarding configuration.
+ *
+ * Copyright (C) Perle Systems
+ * License: GPL v2+
+ */
+
